Hi Lukas, I started as transport planner today and my SAP user only has the b=
asic display roles. I raised request REQ0048213 in the IT portal a few minute=
s ago. It is waiting for your approval as role owner.

What I need for planning the daily outbound runs:
- VT01N / VT02N to create and change shipments
- VL06O to monitor deliveries that are due for shipping

I put Rotterdam as the location in the request. Can you approve it today, or =
tell me if something is missing? I would like to start planning on my own by =
the end of the week.

T-code | Purpose | Access needed
VT01N | Create shipment | Change
VT02N | Change shipment | Change
VL06O | Delivery monitoring (outbound) | Display

Kind regards,
Tom Hendriks
Transport planner
